{"id":"n77156-1-2","stage":4,"title":"줄줄이 · 一条条都。","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77156-1-2-1","ko":"민준이는 어떻게 시험마다 모두 만점을 받는 거야?","zh":"敏俊怎么每次考试都能得满分啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"시험마다","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험마다","audio":"/audio/bd224e9c54317dfd01b8.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"만점을","meaning":"满分","explanation":"만점：满分；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"만점","audio":"/audio/67d1214db2c339ba32ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15817","senseId":"1","lemma":"만점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만점을","audio":"/audio/5756d06c7e548574c36f.mp3"}},{"text":"받는","meaning":"取得，获得","explanation":"받다：取得，获得；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"4","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받는",